  (descr "2x05 2.54 mm pin header mounted on the BACK of the front board, pins toward the rear board. Pads are the KiCad B.Cu mirror of PinHeader_2x05_P2.54mm_Vertical (pin 2 at -2.54), identical to the PinSocket_2x05 pad pattern, so J4B lands pin-for-pin on J4A at the same XY in the stacked frame (notes/circuit.md S4). Body courtyard on B.CrtYd only, so front-side parts may sit above it.")
